Kafka UI

Kafka UI is a web-based graphical interface that allows developers and QA engineers to monitor, inspect, and manage a Kafka cluster without writing command-line commands.
Think of it as a dashboard for Kafka.
Instead of writing Python code just to see whether a message was published, you can open Kafka UI in your browser and inspect the messages visually.
